# {R} to pay for it floating). The grant lasts until end of turn (CR 514.2): in Bot1's main phase on turn 5 it is gone, and
# Boltwave in the graveyard is refused again. Bot2 has taken Boltwave's 3 damage once only, from the hard cast on turn 1.

